  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Riego para altiplano</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EKO-energy, promoters of the Ecolabel green energy source (based in Finland) is supporting Practical Action with the integration of renewable energy solutions for drying or keeping fish cool immediately after catch, irrigation for crops, and overall improved agricultural productivity, food security, income and environmental sustainability in 10 communities in the Altiplano highlands in Bolivia.</narrative>
  </description>
